oddessfall2_04_e_5","text":"In an instant, the tide of battle turns.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_04_e_6","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_04_e_6","text":"The once-endless horde of Raptures begins to thin.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_04_e_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian_q","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_04_e_7","text":"That should do it...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_04_e_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian_q","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_04_e_8","text":"Now for the Queen...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_04_e_9","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_04_e_9","text":"To Marian, the Queen is not her top priority.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_04_e_10","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_04_e_10","text":"Nayuta's clones are gradually dwindling, and with Raptures all around, a proper fight cannot even take place.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_04_e_11","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_04_e_11","text":"Only after she has destroyed well over half their forces does Marian finally turn her gaze toward the Queen.","jump"